    {"id": "jack_003", "text": "Speed is key!", "tags": ["iconic", "funny", "gaming"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "Happy Wheels", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jacksepticeye"}},
    {"id": "jack_004", "text": "All you need is a strong heart and a good attitude and you will get anywhere in life.", "tags": ["motivational", "deep", "heartfelt"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "Jacksepticeye Inspirational Compilation", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jacksepticeye"}},
    {"id": "jack_005", "text": "Life's full of secrets. You just gotta go looking for them.", "tags": ["deep", "life-advice"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "Jacksepticeye Quotes", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jacksepticeye"}},
    {"id": "jack_006", "text": "It doesn't matter if your passion is arranging shoes or something like that. Whatever makes you happy, whatever gives you that drive to get up in the morning — find that.", "tags": ["motivational", "deep", "life-advice"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "Jacksepticeye Inspirational", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jacksepticeye"}},
    {"id": "jack_007", "text": "There is always more joy to be had in life. It may feel like the end, but all it takes is a moment of clarity to turn that moment of turmoil into a moment of enlightenment.", "tags": ["emotional", "deep", "heartfelt"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "Jacksepticeye Mental Health", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jacksepticeye"}},
    {"id": "jack_008", "text": "I truly believe that anybody can get through anything they're going through.", "tags": ["motivational", "emotional", "community"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "Jacksepticeye Inspirational", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jacksepticeye"}},
    {"id": "jack_009", "text": "Doing what is easiest and simplest is not always a good idea. Sometimes it's the hardest stuff that is the best stuff to do.", "tags": ["motivational", "life-advice"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "Jacksepticeye Quotes", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jacksepticeye"}},
    {"id": "jack_010", "text": "Go out there, enjoy yourself, make the most of what you have because none of us know how long we have on this plane of existence.", "tags": ["deep", "life-advice", "motivational"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "Jacksepticeye Inspirational", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jacksepticeye"}},
    {"id": "jack_011", "text": "Learn from your weaknesses and fears, embrace them.", "tags": ["motivational", "life-advice"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "Jacksepticeye Quotes", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jacksepticeye"}},
    {"id": "jack_012", "text": "As long as you're writing from your heart and writing honestly, that's art and no one should ever judge you for that.", "tags": ["deep", "creative", "life-advice"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "Jacksepticeye Creative", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jacksepticeye"}},
    {"id": "jack_013", "text": "SCREW YOU BILLY!", "tags": ["iconic", "funny", "gaming"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "Happy Wheels", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jacksepticeye"}},
    {"id": "jack_014", "text": "Do I need to be dressed like a leprechaun, eating spuds in front of everybody for people to think I'm Irish?", "tags": ["funny", "iconic", "relatable"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "Jacksepticeye Funny Moments", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jacksepticeye"}},
    {"id": "jack_015", "text": "You can wait all you want for great things to happen, but why not try to make them happen right now?", "tags": ["motivational", "life-advice"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "Jacksepticeye Inspirational", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jacksepticeye"}},
    {"id": "jack_016", "text": "You don't have to do amazing things, but as long as you're trying your best to make the most of it, that's a success in my mind.", "tags": ["motivational", "heartfelt", "life-advice"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "Jacksepticeye Inspirational", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jacksepticeye"}},
    {"id": "jack_017", "text": "HAAAAAAAPY WHEEEEEEELS!", "tags": ["iconic", "funny", "gaming"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "Happy Wheels", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jacksepticeye"}},
    {"id": "jack_018", "text": "High fives all round!", "tags": ["iconic", "community", "outro"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "Jacksepticeye Outro", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jacksepticeye"}},
    {"id": "jack_019", "text": "None of us know what lies beyond this state of being, and because we don't know, that makes trying worth it right now.", "tags": ["deep", "philosophical", "life-advice"], "language": "en", "source": {"video_title": "Jacksepticeye Inspirational", "youtube_url": "https://www.youtube.com/@jacksepticeye"}},
